<title>SYRIA: Syria buys 12,000 tonnes rice at $383/tonne.</title>
<headline>Syria buys 12,000 tonnes rice at $383/tonne.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Foreign Trade Organisation for Chemicals and Foostuffs (GEZA) has bought 12,000 tonnes of white rice at $383 a tonne, a company spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He told Reuters the rice, bought from an Indian company, would be delivered in April.</p>
